# Binary build artifact — the Android self-update payload served by
# GET /api/apk/download and hashed by GET /api/apk/info.
# Built by CI / Gradle (`./gradlew assembleDebug`) or fetched from a release
# asset and placed at $APK_PATH (config/constants.js:250). It is not source,
# so it is not committed; see the SHA-256 integrity contract in
# controllers/apk.controller.js for what validates the bytes that are served.
app-debug.apk

